# head/adult/man/expr_tousled: A3's swing face for the tousled hair: the hair's own silhouette on the fierce (strike) frames,
# moved out of man/expr so a bald, cropped or long-haired man's fierce face draws no stray hair pixels
# P2b FACES (wave 2); A3's pixels (docs/ref/style_a3 swing.py). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role hair tousled
layer face
anchor head
keys expr
z 2
tags overlay mirror-ok

